Performs automatic serialization/deserialization between the given objects and the underlying binary data in the
Redis store. By default, it uses Java serialization for its objects (through <a href="../serializer/JdkSerializationRedisSerializer.html" title="class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer"><code>JdkSerializationRedisSerializer</code></a>
). For String intensive operations consider the dedicated <a href="StringRedisTemplate.html" title="class in org.springframework.data.redis.core"><code>StringRedisTemplate</code></a>.
